0
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Information
// Turns the event on and sets how it is announced.
//   Debug log: 1 writes extra lines about the event to the log.
//   Event is on: Turns the event on or off.
//   Announce only on the map: The file calls this AllMaps; the GameServer reads it as AnnounceOnlyMap.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  Debug    Enable    AnnounceOnlyMap
//----------------------------------------------------------
    0        1         1
end


//==============
// [Ref-1]
//==============	
//	     0> Free / 1> Check Entrance / 2> Check Entrance (Only Party)

//==============
// [Ref-2]
//==============	
//	     0> Solo consume entrada el que inicia el evento / 1> Toda la party debe tener la entrada

1
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Entry
// How players get in: by ticket and by level, and the waiting and revival times.
//   Entry style: 0 Free | 1 With a ticket | 2 With a ticket (whole party)
//   Ticket style: 1 also takes a ticket from every party member who comes in; 0 only takes the ticket of whoever talks to the NPC.
//   Ticket item: The category of the ticket item.
//   Ticket item index: The number of the ticket item inside its category.
//   Ticket level: The level the ticket must have. No limit accepts any.
//   Waiting room (minutes): Minutes players stay in the zone after the boss dies before they are moved out.
//   Revive after (minutes): Minutes after the event ends before it can open again.
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~2]         [0~1]          [0~15]        [0~511]        [*/0~15]       [Number]    [Number]
//  EntryStyle    TicketStyle    TicketType    TicketIndex    TicketLevel    WaitTime    RevitalizationTime
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    1             0              14            399            -1             1           2
end

2
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Boss Settings
// How the boss recovers life and when it calls its army and the stones.
//   Life recovered (%): Percentage of its current life the boss recovers each time.
//   Recovers every (seconds): Seconds between one recovery and the next.
//   Invoke the army below (% of life): The boss calls its army when its life falls to this percentage or below.
//   Invoke the stones every (seconds): Seconds between one call of the crystal stones and the next.
//   Most stones: The most crystal stones that can be called in the whole event. Each one also calls a wave of the army.
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~100]      [Number]         [0~100]               [Number]      [Number]
//  RegenLife    RegenLifeTime    MinLifeToRegenArmy    StonesTime    StoneCount
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    05           30               60                    60            4
end

3
//------------------------------------------------------------------
// Player Coordinates
// Where players enter the zone and where they go when the event closes. Place 0 is the entrance, 1 is where they go when their character is closed out, 2 is where they go when the event ends.
//   Place: 0 Where players enter | 1 Where players go when their character is closed out | 2 Where players go when the event ends
//   Map: The map of the place.
//   From X: Left edge of the area.
//   From Y: Top edge of the area.
//   To X: Right edge of the area.
//   To Y: Bottom edge of the area.
//------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [Number]    [Number]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]
//  Pos         Map         X          Y          X2         Y2
//------------------------------------------------------------------
    0           83          21         229        28         231        //Enter Coords
    1           83          25         117        29         121        //Character Close - Player Coords.
    2           83          36         113        42         126        //End Event - Player Coords.
end

4
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Crystal Stones
// Where each crystal stone stands.
//   Stone: The stone: 1 to 4. Each one is called after the boss calls its army.
//   From X: Left edge of the area.
//   From Y: Top edge of the area.
//   To X: Right edge of the area.
//   To Y: Bottom edge of the area.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [1~4]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]
//  Index    X          Y          X2         Y2
//----------------------------------------------------------
    1        30         225        30         225        // UP
    2        33         211        33         211        // Down
    3        23         215        23         215        // Left
    4        37         220        37         200        // Right
end

5
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Boss Coordinates
// Where the boss appears.
//   From X: Left edge of the area.
//   From Y: Top edge of the area.
//   To X: Right edge of the area.
//   To Y: Bottom edge of the area.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]
//  X          Y          X2         Y2
//----------------------------------------------------------
    30         218        31         219
end

//=========================================
// Informacion de crystal y army por stage:
//==============================================================
//Anotacion sobre el index 2 = (Max Regen Stone Count + Army)
//Si agregamos mas "Max Regen" coordinar grupo para cada stage
//==============================================================
//-------Default a 4 max regen-----------
//-Nixie Boss inicia solo
//-Stage Inicial - Only Army
//-Stage1-Crystal + Group 0 
//-Stage2-Crystal + Group 1
//-Stage3-Crystal + Group 2
//-Stage4-Crystal + Group 3

6
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Army
// The monsters each group spawns and the multipliers applied to them.
//   Group: The wave: 0 is the first one (only the army); the next ones come together with the crystal stones.
//   Monster: The monster that appears.
//   Monsters per group: How many of this monster appear.
//   Attribute: The attribute (element) the monster has.
//   From X: Left edge of the area.
//   From Y: Top edge of the area.
//   To X: Right edge of the area.
//   To Y: Bottom edge of the area.
//   Minimum damage x: What its minimum damage is multiplied by. -1 leaves it as it is.
//   Maximum damage x: What its maximum damage is multiplied by. -1 leaves it as it is.
//   Defense x: What its defense is multiplied by. -1 leaves it as it is.
//   Attack rate x: What its attack success rate is multiplied by. -1 leaves it as it is.
//   Defense rate x: What its defense success rate is multiplied by. -1 leaves it as it is.
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
