//----------------------------------------------------------
// Boss Skills
// The skills the boss uses.
//   Skill: The skill given to the boss. Which attack it is comes from the position of the row: row 1 is Ice, row 2 Ice Storm and row 3 Sleep.
//   Chance (%): Chance of using it each time the boss attacks.
//   Time (seconds): Seconds before the boss can use it again.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [Number]    [0~100]    [Number]
//  Skill       Rate       Time
//----------------------------------------------------------
    7           40         5           // Ice
    39          30         10          // Ice Storm
    219         10         15          // Sleep (Summoner)
end